WEBVTT

00:19.430 --> 00:21.520
<b>Shampoo!</b>

00:22.430 --> 00:23.980
<b>Ranma, I'll kill you.</b>

00:25.060 --> 00:27.730
<b><i>The Chinese Amazons</i>
<i>take extreme pride in themselves.</i></b>

00:28.570 --> 00:31.570
<b><i>Losing to an outsider</i>
<i>is a dishonor worse than death.</i></b>

00:32.690 --> 00:34.450
<b><i>The Kiss of Death is</i></b>

00:34.530 --> 00:37.240
<b><i>a deadly pledge</i>
<i>to chase you to the depths of hell</i></b>

00:37.320 --> 00:38.990
<b><i>and kill you!</i></b>

00:41.490 --> 00:43.620
<b>Don't make trouble in someone's house!</b>

00:47.130 --> 00:48.540
<b>Oh, dear.</b>

00:48.630 --> 00:49.790
<b>Poor girl.</b>

00:49.880 --> 00:52.800
<b>Looks like she lost again.</b>

00:54.050 --> 00:56.510
<b>You didn't lose.
That was an accident! Pure luck!</b>

00:56.590 --> 00:57.970
<b>Booyah!</b>

00:59.010 --> 01:01.600
<b>Just accept her Kiss of Death.</b>

01:08.230 --> 01:09.230
<b>What?</b>

01:17.240 --> 01:21.490
<b>RANMA1/2</b>

02:49.960 --> 02:54.790
<b>YOU I LOVE</b>

03:14.360 --> 03:16.520
<b>What's all this commotion about?</b>

03:16.610 --> 03:17.860
<b>Dad!</b>

03:18.530 --> 03:21.400
<b>I'm not quite following what's going on,</b>

03:22.030 --> 03:26.530
<b>but Ranma's girlfriend came all the way
from China to reclaim their relationship.</b>

03:27.040 --> 03:28.040
<b>Girlfriend?</b>

03:28.120 --> 03:31.040
<b>Don't make stuff up in a panic!</b>

03:31.120 --> 03:33.960
<b>It doesn't stray too far
from the truth though, does it?</b>

03:34.040 --> 03:36.790
<b>Today is my first interaction
with her as a guy!</b>

03:36.880 --> 03:39.550
<b>Even so, you two seem awfully intimate.</b>

03:39.630 --> 03:41.420
<b>You and that Shampoo.</b>

03:41.510 --> 03:42.590
<b><i>Aiyaa.</i></b>

03:42.680 --> 03:44.930
<b>Akane, you…</b>

03:45.510 --> 03:46.510
<b>What?</b>

03:50.100 --> 03:51.680
<b>Suit yourself.</b>

03:51.770 --> 03:55.650
<b>If that's how you guys see me…</b>

03:56.270 --> 03:57.270
<b>Ranma.</b>

03:57.360 --> 03:59.150
<b>It's the only way we can see you.</b>

03:59.650 --> 04:01.440
<b>YEP</b>

04:01.530 --> 04:05.660
<b>Please consider our engagement dissolved!</b>

04:08.080 --> 04:09.080
<b>Akane!</b>

04:09.660 --> 04:11.540
<b>Hey, Shampoo. You!</b>

04:11.620 --> 04:13.460
<b>-Anyhow…
-Get off of me!</b>

04:14.830 --> 04:18.290
<b>You have some explaining to do, Ranma.</b>

04:18.380 --> 04:20.710
<b>Like I keep saying,</b>

04:20.800 --> 04:22.220
<b>-I have no clue…
-Poke, poke.</b>

04:23.550 --> 04:25.390
<b>CHINESE AMAZON SUTRA</b>

04:25.470 --> 04:26.470
<b>Look.</b>

04:28.050 --> 04:31.220
<b>Let's see here. "Chinese Amazon Sutra"…</b>

04:37.520 --> 04:39.020
<b>I can't believe it!</b>

04:39.730 --> 04:41.230
<b>What's written in it?</b>

04:41.320 --> 04:42.440
<b>You buffoon!</b>

04:42.530 --> 04:44.570
<b>I can't read any Chinese!</b>

04:44.650 --> 04:47.240
<b>Don't be so smug
while your eyes are full of tears!</b>

04:47.820 --> 04:50.030
<b>"The Laws of the Chinese Amazons."</b>

04:50.120 --> 04:52.620
<b>Welcome back home, Nabiki.</b>

04:55.670 --> 04:58.630
<b>"Should a female warrior
be defeated by an outsider,</b>

04:59.460 --> 05:02.090
<b><i>if she is bested by a woman,</i></b>

05:02.170 --> 05:04.260
<b><i>she must give her the Kiss of Death</i></b>

05:05.010 --> 05:06.130
<b><i>and kill her.</i></b>

05:07.220 --> 05:10.640
<b><i>However, should she be defeated by a man,</i></b>

05:11.760 --> 05:13.470
<b><i>she must join with him in marriage."</i></b>

05:15.230 --> 05:16.230
<b>Oh, my.</b>

05:18.520 --> 05:20.480
<b>That's a bunch of hogwash!</b>

05:21.070 --> 05:23.610
<b>Do I look like
the type to tell jokes to you?</b>

05:23.690 --> 05:24.740
<b>Yes, you do!</b>

05:24.820 --> 05:26.900
<b>To start, can you even read Chinese?</b>

05:28.450 --> 05:30.330
<b>-Of course…
-You can?</b>

05:30.410 --> 05:31.780
<b>…I can't.</b>

05:33.200 --> 05:35.620
<b>The Japanese translation is over here.</b>

05:35.710 --> 05:37.080
<b>You're right.</b>

05:39.250 --> 05:41.090
<b>I see!</b>

05:43.050 --> 05:45.550
<b>Ranma, you stupid…</b>

05:45.630 --> 05:48.090
<b>Stupid Ranma. Stupid!</b>

05:48.180 --> 05:51.350
<b>Ranma, you stupid…</b>

05:51.430 --> 05:53.220
<b>Stupid!</b>

05:54.180 --> 05:56.680
<b>Stupid Ranma!</b>

06:02.900 --> 06:04.230
<b>That hits the spot.</b>

06:13.080 --> 06:17.160
<b>The engagement is something
our parents decided on their own.</b>

06:18.660 --> 06:22.630
<b>It's not like we liked
each other or anything.</b>

06:24.170 --> 06:26.710
<b>Akane is my fiancée, you hear me?</b>

06:27.340 --> 06:29.090
<b>Mess with her, and you're dead!</b>

06:52.870 --> 06:54.830
<b>Listen to me, Shampoo.</b>

06:55.990 --> 06:59.710
<b>Nowadays, these old-fashioned laws,
like killing a woman who defeats you</b>

06:59.790 --> 07:02.040
<b>but marrying them if it's a guy,</b>

07:02.540 --> 07:04.840
<b>they are total nonsense.</b>

07:05.340 --> 07:06.340
<b>Laws?</b>

07:07.000 --> 07:08.170
<b>In other words…</b>

07:09.090 --> 07:11.720
<b>She totally came here uninvited.</b>

07:12.220 --> 07:13.510
<b>Nabiki and Kasumi.</b>

07:14.850 --> 07:18.020
<b>Why don't you go
and make it up to Ranma, Akane?</b>

07:18.560 --> 07:23.560
<b>To begin with, do you think Ranma
even had the guts to get a girlfriend?</b>

07:28.780 --> 07:30.400
<b>Do you understand, Shampoo?</b>

07:35.160 --> 07:37.540
<b>Yep, you have no clue what I just said.</b>

07:38.660 --> 07:40.710
<b>"<i>Wo de ai ren</i>." Let's see here.</b>

07:40.790 --> 07:42.290
<b>That's "My husband."</b>

07:45.170 --> 07:49.920
<b>So I'm saying I have
no interest in dating you.</b>

07:59.930 --> 08:01.770
<b>Like I said,</b>

08:02.640 --> 08:05.480
<b>it's that, you and I, we're…</b>

08:06.110 --> 08:09.980
<b>A marriage dictated by law is, you know,</b>

08:10.070 --> 08:12.320
<b>it's just, like…</b>

08:12.400 --> 08:14.240
<b>-"<i>Wo ai ni.</i>"
-…a bit obsolete, and…</b>

08:14.320 --> 08:17.330
<b>-That's "I love you," Akane.
-…it's not a good reason, you see?</b>

08:18.490 --> 08:20.450
<b>This is aggravating.</b>

08:21.250 --> 08:23.920
<b>So we ought to</b>

08:24.540 --> 08:27.500
<b>get to know each other</b>

08:27.590 --> 08:30.840
<b>a little better, right--</b>

08:31.920 --> 08:34.550
<b>Oh, dear. Look at him all flustered.</b>

08:35.300 --> 08:37.050
<b>This is fun to watch, Akane…</b>

08:44.270 --> 08:45.520
<b>LISTEN TO YOURSELF, DOLT!</b>

08:45.600 --> 08:46.690
<b>Husband!</b>

09:01.290 --> 09:05.120
<b><i>She's only ever tried to kill me,</i>
<i>so I never noticed it…</i></b>

09:06.920 --> 09:08.210
<b><i>I love you.</i></b>

09:09.750 --> 09:12.300
<b><i>…but Shampoo is pretty cute.</i></b>

09:12.880 --> 09:15.220
<b><i>If only Akane was</i>
<i>that straightforward with me.</i></b>

09:17.590 --> 09:18.720
<b>Icy!</b>

09:19.510 --> 09:21.390
<b>Ryoga, the hell was that for?</b>

09:24.560 --> 09:29.440
<b>Watching Akane get jealous over you…</b>

09:31.900 --> 09:34.400
<b>really, really hurts me!</b>

09:36.320 --> 09:38.860
<b>You jerk, I couldn't care less
about your feelings!</b>

09:38.950 --> 09:40.240
<b>Ouch!</b>

09:40.320 --> 09:44.330
<b>I hope Shampoo finds you as a girl
and beats the hell out of you!</b>

09:44.830 --> 09:48.330
<b>And I hope Akane finds you as a pig
and makes a meal outta you!</b>

09:49.630 --> 09:51.380
<b>Don't call me a pig!</b>

09:52.170 --> 09:55.590
<b>That's right. You have a name, P-chan!</b>

09:57.630 --> 09:58.840
<b>You're gonna get it now!</b>

10:02.350 --> 10:03.600
<b>"Bleh" to you!</b>

10:19.110 --> 10:20.410
<b>Serves you right.</b>

10:23.490 --> 10:27.370
<b>To begin with, Akane's
making herself jealous--</b>

10:33.420 --> 10:36.010
<b>I'm not bothered. Not one teeny bit.</b>

10:36.800 --> 10:40.590
<b>After all, we're no longer fiancées.
Or anything, for that matter.</b>

10:40.680 --> 10:43.260
<b>You see, that was--</b>

10:43.850 --> 10:46.520
<b>Go get to know each other all you'd like!</b>

10:48.020 --> 10:49.310
<b>Let's go, P-chan.</b>

10:57.860 --> 10:59.450
<b>Miss Akane?</b>

11:02.910 --> 11:04.580
<b>Ranma, I'll kill you.</b>

11:06.120 --> 11:07.330
<b>Give me a minute!</b>

11:07.410 --> 11:08.410
<b>I'll kill you!</b>

11:10.000 --> 11:12.170
<b>Cut it out already.</b>

11:12.250 --> 11:15.380
<b>I'll kill you!</b>

11:16.170 --> 11:17.170
<b>Hey! I said wait!</b>

11:17.760 --> 11:20.130
<b>Seriously, you're gonna kill me!</b>

11:21.680 --> 11:23.550
<b>-Will you please stop?
-I'll kill you!</b>

11:24.390 --> 11:25.390
<b>I'll kill you!</b>

11:26.100 --> 11:29.140
<b>I'll kill you!</b>

11:29.230 --> 11:30.770
<b><i>Aiyaa!</i></b>

11:32.060 --> 11:34.110
<b>As a man, he is pursued for love.</b>

11:34.190 --> 11:37.360
<b>As a woman, he is pursued for his life.</b>

11:38.820 --> 11:43.110
<b>They really need to learn
about each other.</b>

11:43.200 --> 11:44.280
<b>I'll kill you!</b>

11:47.990 --> 11:49.790
<b>Stupid Ranma.</b>

12:00.050 --> 12:01.720
<b>ANYTHING GOES
MARTIAL ARTS TENDO DOJO</b>

12:01.800 --> 12:03.880
<b>P-chan, where are you?</b>

12:03.970 --> 12:06.220
<b>P-chan's gone missing again.</b>

12:10.600 --> 12:13.270
<b>Akane, will you get Ranma out of bed?</b>

12:14.150 --> 12:15.440
<b>Why me?</b>

12:15.980 --> 12:17.310
<b>Why not?</b>

12:17.900 --> 12:21.190
<b>You're still upset at Ranma and Shampoo.</b>

12:22.280 --> 12:23.280
<b>Not even.</b>

12:24.820 --> 12:26.160
<b>Akane.</b>

12:26.780 --> 12:30.490
<b>You ought to be a little more honest
about your feelings.</b>

12:31.580 --> 12:32.790
<b>What's that?</b>

12:36.710 --> 12:38.630
<b>I'm scared! I'm so scared!</b>

12:38.710 --> 12:40.800
<b>Come on, Dad, pull yourself together.</b>

12:41.380 --> 12:42.920
<b>There's no need to cry.</b>

12:44.300 --> 12:46.800
<b>Ranma, how long will you sleep in?</b>

12:52.640 --> 12:53.850
<b>Husband…</b>

13:00.770 --> 13:01.780
<b>That's cold!</b>

13:04.280 --> 13:08.240
<b>What was that for, Akane?
You pickin' a fight first thing in the--</b>

13:08.820 --> 13:10.410
<b>My husband.</b>

13:11.240 --> 13:14.250
<b>Shampoo? Why are you here?</b>

13:21.250 --> 13:22.960
<b>Girl Ranma!</b>

13:23.460 --> 13:24.470
<b>I'll kill you!</b>

13:25.260 --> 13:27.720
<b>What the hell is wrong with you?</b>

13:29.050 --> 13:30.430
<b>I'll kill you!</b>

13:30.510 --> 13:32.970
<b>Look. When did Shampoo get here?</b>

13:37.020 --> 13:38.650
<b>I'll set the record straight.</b>

13:38.730 --> 13:41.360
<b>Shampoo snuck in without my knowing.</b>

13:41.440 --> 13:43.610
<b>I didn't ask you.</b>

13:44.110 --> 13:45.950
<b>How naughty. So early in the day.</b>

13:46.820 --> 13:49.410
<b>You really don't listen, do you?</b>

13:49.990 --> 13:52.330
<b>You're the one who cuddles with the pig.</b>

13:52.410 --> 13:54.250
<b>Why bring up P-chan now?</b>

13:57.000 --> 13:59.630
<b>This is stupid.
You're getting jealous of a pig.</b>

14:00.670 --> 14:04.000
<b>As if anyone would
ever get jealous over you.</b>

14:06.420 --> 14:09.680
<b>Sorry, my hand slipped.</b>

14:09.760 --> 14:12.560
<b>You really aren't cute!</b>

14:12.640 --> 14:14.600
<b>Fine by me.</b>

14:20.900 --> 14:22.190
<b><i>Akane.</i></b>

14:22.860 --> 14:25.940
<b><i>I'll depart on a journey</i>
<i>without saying goodbye.</i></b>

14:31.030 --> 14:35.580
<b><i>To you, I can only be P-chan the pet pig.</i></b>

14:37.450 --> 14:40.420
<b>She's heartbroken
because of Ranma's unfaithfulness.</b>

14:41.130 --> 14:44.170
<b>Now is your chance to steal her heart.</b>

14:44.750 --> 14:46.050
<b>That's terrible!</b>

14:46.130 --> 14:47.510
<b>Shut up!</b>

14:47.590 --> 14:49.840
<b>Remember what Ranma has done to you.</b>

14:50.340 --> 14:53.550
<b>Remember why you will only
ever be a pet pig to Akane.</b>

14:55.010 --> 14:56.680
<b>Now's your chance.</b>

14:56.770 --> 14:58.180
<b>Don't listen to him!</b>

14:58.270 --> 15:02.400
<b>If you stand around and do nothing, that
Chinese girl might end up killing Ranma.</b>

15:02.480 --> 15:03.900
<b>That's your real chance.</b>

15:04.610 --> 15:06.230
<b>You're worse than me!</b>

15:06.730 --> 15:10.610
<b>No need to get your hands dirty.
Patience is a virtue, remember?</b>

15:10.700 --> 15:11.610
<b><i>But…</i></b>

15:11.700 --> 15:13.910
<b>Why delay?
Take advantage of this opportunity.</b>

15:13.990 --> 15:15.740
<b>No, it's still too early.</b>

15:15.830 --> 15:17.750
<b>But!</b>

15:18.450 --> 15:20.330
<b>I'm sorry, Ryoga.</b>

15:20.410 --> 15:24.670
<b>But even still, I love Ranma.</b>

15:25.340 --> 15:27.420
<b><i>Imagine if that were to happen.</i></b>

15:28.420 --> 15:32.130
<b>My heart of glass will shatter to pieces.</b>

15:33.840 --> 15:35.970
<b>Farewell, Akane.</b>

15:45.560 --> 15:46.570
<b>There.</b>

15:49.490 --> 15:50.490
<b>Come over here.</b>

15:50.990 --> 15:52.070
<b>Over here.</b>

16:01.370 --> 16:03.500
<b>It's lunchtime.</b>

16:03.580 --> 16:05.170
<b>I'm starved.</b>

16:09.210 --> 16:10.300
<b>What's that sound?</b>

16:11.760 --> 16:13.680
<b>-Oh, no.
-It's coming nearer.</b>

16:20.890 --> 16:22.310
<b>Boy Ranma.</b>

16:22.810 --> 16:24.980
<b>Give me a break, Shampoo.</b>

16:25.480 --> 16:27.900
<b>What do you want from me?</b>

16:28.570 --> 16:29.940
<b>It's a bento made with love.</b>

16:48.210 --> 16:49.800
<b>P-chan!</b>

16:50.750 --> 16:52.090
<b>What are you doing?</b>

16:52.800 --> 16:53.800
<b>Open your mouth.</b>

16:56.680 --> 16:58.100
<b>Come on, hey!</b>

17:00.470 --> 17:01.470
<b>Ouch!</b>

17:02.220 --> 17:05.560
<b>I'm so glad you're okay, P-chan!</b>

17:29.040 --> 17:31.300
<b><i>The Kiss of Death.</i></b>

17:34.550 --> 17:35.840
<b>This will be fun.</b>

17:36.840 --> 17:39.550
<b>All right, I accept your challenge.</b>

17:41.140 --> 17:43.810
<b>Come on, now. Your pet pig is alive, and--</b>

17:43.890 --> 17:44.890
<b>Shut up!</b>

17:46.270 --> 17:49.610
<b><i>After everything she's done,</i>
<i>I'll settle this once and for all.</i></b>

17:50.310 --> 17:52.650
<b>A slowpoke like you</b>

17:54.320 --> 17:56.650
<b>doesn't stand a chance against Shampoo!</b>

17:56.740 --> 17:58.410
<b>Who are you calling a slowpoke?</b>

17:58.490 --> 17:59.740
<b>-Watch out!
-What?</b>

18:05.120 --> 18:07.250
<b>Stay safe right here for me, P-chan.</b>

18:09.420 --> 18:11.750
<b>It's okay, don't worry.</b>

18:17.930 --> 18:19.640
<b>The Kiss of Death.</b>

18:19.720 --> 18:23.310
<b>I'll chase you to the depths of hell
and kill you.</b>

18:23.390 --> 18:24.930
<b>Don't worry.</b>

18:25.020 --> 18:26.560
<b>I won't run or hide.</b>

18:27.480 --> 18:29.270
<b>I'll settle this right here and now.</b>

18:33.570 --> 18:35.900
<b>Hey! Get ahold of yourself.</b>

18:36.650 --> 18:39.570
<b>Crap, that hit him hard.</b>

18:44.280 --> 18:45.200
<b>Akane!</b>

18:45.290 --> 18:46.830
<b>She already left.</b>

18:47.750 --> 18:49.370
<b>Say what?</b>

18:56.960 --> 18:58.130
<b>Akane.</b>

19:00.380 --> 19:01.390
<b>Akane!</b>

19:17.030 --> 19:18.030
<b><i>Akane.</i></b>

19:33.000 --> 19:34.170
<b>Akane!</b>

19:50.480 --> 19:51.480
<b><i>Akane.</i></b>

19:51.980 --> 19:54.690
<b><i>Akane!</i></b>

19:55.270 --> 19:56.400
<b><i>Akane!</i></b>

20:05.910 --> 20:08.540
<b>Akane!</b>

20:15.040 --> 20:16.040
<b>Ryoga.</b>

20:29.470 --> 20:30.640
<b>Akane!</b>

20:32.100 --> 20:33.100
<b>Akane.</b>

20:34.850 --> 20:37.190
<b>Come on, wake up!</b>

20:41.650 --> 20:45.740
<b>Akane!</b>

21:00.420 --> 21:01.590
<b>Akane!</b>

21:12.020 --> 21:13.480
<b>Idiot!</b>

21:14.140 --> 21:15.770
<b>This is why I tried to stop you.</b>

21:21.320 --> 21:22.480
<b>Akane?</b>

21:25.570 --> 21:27.410
<b>Who are you?</b>

21:28.070 --> 21:29.120
<b><i>What?</i></b>

22:56.950 --> 23:01.960
<b>Subtitle translation by:
Megumi Hunter</b>
